{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LAM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米哀歌","commonName":"耶利米哀歌","title":"耶利米哀歌","order":25,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"116b5eec352d92466c3407c484861baa5fe24f8d05cb718844c986cf0d754a57","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":154},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["淒慘的耶路撒冷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"從前人煙稠密的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在何其荒涼！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從前揚威列邦的強國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在竟像寡婦！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從前在諸省貴為公主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在卻淪為奴婢！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"她在夜間痛哭，淚流滿面。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"情人中沒有一個前來安慰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"朋友都出賣她，與她為敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"猶大飽受苦難和奴役，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被擄往遠方，流落異邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"找不到安居之所。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她在走投無路之際被追敵擒獲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"通往錫安的道路滿目淒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為無人前去過節。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城門冷落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的祭司悲歎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的少女哀傷，她痛苦不已。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"仇敵做了她的主人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的敵人安逸發達。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她作惡多端，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華叫她飽受困苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的孩子被敵人擄去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"少女錫安的尊榮消逝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的首領像找不到草吃的鹿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無力逃脫敵人的追趕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"在困苦流離中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷想起昔日的榮華。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今，她的人民落在敵人手中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人援救。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的仇敵幸災樂禍，嘲笑她的滅亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷罪大惡極，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"淪為污穢之物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從前尊重她的人看見她赤身裸體，就蔑視她。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她只能哀歎、退避。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"她的裙子沾滿污穢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她未曾想過自己的結局。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的敗落令人震驚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人安慰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她哭喊道：「耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敵已經獲勝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你垂顧我的苦難！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"敵人伸手奪去她的一切珍寶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她目睹外族人闖入聖殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華禁止他們進入祂的會眾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"她的人民呻吟著四處覓食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用珍寶換取糧食維生。","poem":1},"耶路撒冷的哀歎",{"text":"她說：「耶和華啊，求你垂顧我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我被人蔑視。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「路人啊，你們都無動於衷嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華向我發烈怒，降禍於我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"還有誰比我更痛苦呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"「祂從高天降下火來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使火在我骨中燃燒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂在我腳前設下網羅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我返回；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使我淒涼孤寂，終日痛苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「我的罪惡連接成軛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂親手把它們綁在一起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"繫在我的頸項上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我精疲力盡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主把我交給我無力抵擋的敵人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"「主棄絕我所有的勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召集軍隊攻擊我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打垮我的青年。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主踐踏處女猶大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同在榨酒池中踩踏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"「我為此哭泣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"淚流滿面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻無人安慰、鼓勵我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的兒女淒涼孤苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為仇敵已經得勝。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"錫安伸手求助，卻無人安慰她。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已命四周鄰國與雅各為敵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷在他們當中成了污穢之物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"「但耶和華是公義的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我違背了祂的命令。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國啊，請聽我的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看我的痛苦！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的少男少女都被擄去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「我向情人們求助，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻欺騙我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的祭司和長老在覓食求生時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倒斃在城中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看我是多麼痛苦！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我愁腸百結，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心靈翻騰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我極其悖逆。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"街上有刀劍奪命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"家中有死亡籠罩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"「人們聽見我的哀歎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻無人安慰我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人聽說你降給我的災難，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都幸災樂禍。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你宣告的審判之日來臨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫他們像我一樣受苦！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"「願他們的惡行都擺在你眼前！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎樣因我一切的罪惡而懲罰我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你也照樣懲罰他們！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我歎息不絕，心中哀傷。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}